    "dependency": "needs per-manifest parsing; the demo would only be able to say that a manifest changed, which `governance` already says",
    "hands": "deleted 2026-09-02, not unwritten. It counted distinct committers per window; `questions.md` asks nothing about people or rates of work, so every candidate it ever produced was dropped. Removing a detector whose output no question can use is what this project says to do before raising a limit"
  },
  "exclude": [
